  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estos peques que ves aquí son Trubbish, también\nconocidos como los Pokémon Bolsa Basura.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que les gusta comerse las sobras y los\ndesechos de la cafetería y por eso han empezado<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na frecuentar nuestro establecimiento.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Trub, truuub!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054007200750062002C002000740072007500750075006200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me alegro de que puedan aprovechar las sobras,\npero a mucha gente le incomoda bastante<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nel olor y hemos empezado a perder clientes...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero se me ha ocurrido una idea!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F0020007300650020006D00650020006800610020006F006300750072007200690064006F00200075006E0061002000690064006500610021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya que lo que los atrae tanto son las sobras,\npodríamos usarlas para llevarlos a otra parte.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He preparado una bolsa de Basura Suculenta que\nseguro que les resulta irresistible.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Te importaría usarla como cebo para llevártelos\nde aquí?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Avísame cuando estés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007600ED00730061006D00650020006300750061006E0064006F002000650073007400E900730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F00610021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que hoy esta área se está usando como\nzona de combate.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo vas a poder encargarte de los Trubbish\nahora mismo. Vuelve mañana, por favor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me gustaría que te llevases a los Trubbish hasta\nlos cubos de basura que hay al final del callejón.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Estás list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos allá!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300200061006C006C00E100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Necesito un poco más de tiempo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006500630065007300690074006F00200075006E00200070006F0063006F0020006D00E100730020006400650020007400690065006D0070006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De verdad que me harías un favor enorme porque\nestoy hasta arriba de trabajo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchas gracias! ¡Me sacas de un buen apuro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00750063006800610073002000670072006100630069006100730021002000A1004D006500200073006100630061007300200064006500200075006E0020006200750065006E00200061007000750072006F0021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si llevas esto contigo, seguro que los Trubbish\nte siguen hasta los cubos de basura.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Procura caminar despacio para que los Trubbish\nno te pierdan de vista!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para llegar a los cubos de basura, avanza por\neste callejón. ¡No tiene pérdida!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ve por aquí y deja la Basura Suculenta al final\ndel callejón.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006500200070006F0072002000610071007500ED00200079002000640065006A00610020006C0061002000420061007300750072006100200053007500630075006C0065006E0074006100200061006C002000660069006E0061006C000A00640065006C002000630061006C006C0065006A00F3006E002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Haz que los Trubbish te sigan hasta el final\ndel callejón.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007A00200071007500650020006C006F007300200054007200750062006200690073006800200074006500200073006900670061006E00200068006100730074006100200065006C002000660069006E0061006C000A00640065006C002000630061006C006C0065006A00F3006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres dejar la Basura Suculenta al lado\nde los cubos de basura?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500690065007200650073002000640065006A006100720020006C0061002000420061007300750072006100200053007500630075006C0065006E0074006100200061006C0020006C00610064006F000A006400650020006C006F00730020006300750062006F00730020006400650020006200610073007500720061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bish!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004200690073006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Trubbish están devorando la Basura\nSuculenta con mucho entusiasmo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0073002000540072007500620062006900730068002000650073007400E1006E0020006400650076006F00720061006E0064006F0020006C00610020004200610073007500720061000A0053007500630075006C0065006E0074006100200063006F006E0020006D007500630068006F00200065006E007400750073006900610073006D006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchas gracias por traer la basura!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D007500630068006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F00720020007400720061006500720020006C006100200062006100730075007200610021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora el olor de los Trubbish ya no llegará hasta\nnuestro café.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F0072006100200065006C0020006F006C006F00720020006400650020006C006F00730020005400720075006200620069007300680020007900610020006E006F0020006C006C006500670061007200E1002000680061007300740061000A006E00750065007300740072006F002000630061006600E9002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hay que ver cuánto comen estos Trubbish.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006100790020007100750065002000760065007200200063007500E1006E0074006F00200063006F006D0065006E0020006500730074006F0073002000540072007500620062006900730068002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estaba pensando que... convivir con los Pokémon\nno se limita solo a tenerlos cerca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por ejemplo, a los Trubbish les encanta la comida\nde nuestro café, pero no puedo dejar que coman<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon los clientes, ¿no?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quizá la mejor manera de convivir con ellos sea\nmantener una cierta distancia para que todos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npodamos disfrutar nuestro propio espacio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uy, le siguen unos Pokémon...\n¡Qué escena más adorable!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550079002C0020006C0065002000730069006700750065006E00200075006E006F007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002E002E000A00A10051007500E900200065007300630065006E00610020006D00E10073002000610064006F007200610062006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh... Huele bastante\nmal, ¿verdad?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068002E002E002E0020004800750065006C0065002000620061007300740061006E00740065000A006D0061006C002C002000BF007600650072006400610064003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Es un Falinks o tengo\nque graduarme la vista?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045007300200075006E002000460061006C0069006E006B00730020006F002000740065006E0067006F000A00710075006500200067007200610064007500610072006D00650020006C0061002000760069007300740061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esos pequeñines parecen\ntener hambre de basura.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073006F007300200070006500710075006500F10069006E006500730020007000610072006500630065006E000A00740065006E00650072002000680061006D0062007200650020006400650020006200610073007500720061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿De excursión con unos Trubbish?\n¡Pues suena divertido!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004400650020006500780063007500720073006900F3006E00200063006F006E00200075006E006F0073002000540072007500620062006900730068003F000A00A100500075006500730020007300750065006E0061002000640069007600650072007400690064006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
